-- Intermediate 1: 한국의 사계절 (Four Seasons in Korea)
(
    '한국의 사계절',
    'Empat Musim di Korea',
    'Four Seasons in Korea',
    '한국은 봄, 여름, 가을, 겨울 네 계절이 뚜렷한 나라예요. 봄에는 벚꽃이 피고 날씨가 따뜻해져서 공원에 나가기 좋아요. 여름은 덥고 습해서 사람들이 바다로 많이 가요. 장마철에는 비가 자주 오기 때문에 우산을 꼭 가져가야 해요. 가을에는 단풍이 아름답고 하늘이 높아서 등산하기에 딱 좋은 계절이에요. 겨울은 눈이 많이 오고 매우 추워서 두꺼운 옷을 입어야 하지만, 따뜻한 국물 요리를 먹으면 행복해져요. 한국 사람들은 계절마다 다른 음식과 활동을 즐기면서 자연의 변화를 느끼며 살아요.',
    'Korea adalah negara yang memiliki empat musim yang sangat jelas: semi, panas, gugur, dan dingin. Di musim semi, bunga sakura mekar dan cuaca menjadi hangat sehingga menyenangkan untuk pergi ke taman. Musim panas terasa panas dan lembap, sehingga banyak orang pergi ke pantai. Saat musim hujan, sering turun hujan jadi harus membawa payung. Di musim gugur, daun-daun berubah warna indah dan langit tinggi, menjadikannya musim yang sempurna untuk mendaki. Musim dingin banyak salju dan sangat dingin sehingga harus memakai pakaian tebal, tapi makan sup hangat membuat bahagia. Orang Korea menikmati makanan dan aktivitas berbeda setiap musim sambil merasakan perubahan alam.',
    'Korea is a country with four distinct seasons: spring, summer, autumn, and winter. In spring, cherry blossoms bloom and the weather warms up, making it nice to go to parks. Summer is hot and humid, so many people go to the beach. During the rainy season it rains often, so you must bring an umbrella. In autumn, the fall foliage is beautiful and the sky is high, making it the perfect season for hiking. Winter brings lots of snow and is very cold so you must wear thick clothes, but eating warm soup makes you happy. Koreans enjoy different foods and activities each season while feeling the changes of nature.',
    'intermediate',
    'travel',
    'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534274988757-a28bf1a57c17?q=80&w=400&auto=format&fit=crop',
    TRUE,
    '[{"t":"한국은","l":"한국"},{"t":" "},{"t":"봄","l":"봄"},{"t":","},{"t":" "},{"t":"여름","l":"여름"},{"t":","},{"t":" "},{"t":"가을","l":"가을"},{"t":","},{"t":" "},{"t":"겨울","l":"겨울"},{"t":" "},{"t":"네","l":"네"},{"t":" "},{"t":"계절이","l":"계절"},{"t":" "},{"t":"뚜렷한","l":"뚜렷하다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"나라예요","l":"나라"},{"t":"."},{"t":"\n"},{"t":"봄에는","l":"봄"},{"t":" "},{"t":"벚꽃이","l":"벚꽃"},{"t":" "},{"t":"피고","l":"피다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"날씨가","l":"날씨"},{"t":" "},{"t":"따뜻해져서","l":"따뜻해지다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"공원에","l":"공원"},{"t":" "},{"t":"나가기","l":"나가다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"좋아요","l":"좋다"},{"t":"."},{"t":"\n"},{"t":"여름은","l":"여름"},{"t":" "},{"t":"덥고","l":"덥다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"습해서","l":"습하다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"사람들이","l":"사람"},{"t":" "},{"t":"바다로","l":"바다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"많이","l":"많다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"가요","l":"가다"},{"t":"."},{"t":"\n"},{"t":"장마철에는","l":"장마철"},{"t":" "},{"t":"비가","l":"비"},{"t":" "},{"t":"자주","l":"자주"},{"t":" "},{"t":"오기","l":"오다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"때문에","l":"때문"},{"t":" "},{"t":"우산을","l":"우산"},{"t":" "},{"t":"꼭","l":"꼭"},{"t":" "},{"t":"가져가야","l":"가져가다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"해요","l":"하다"},{"t":"."},{"t":"\n"},{"t":"가을에는","l":"가을"},{"t":" "},{"t":"단풍이","l":"단풍"},{"t":" "},{"t":"아름답고","l":"아름답다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"하늘이","l":"하늘"},{"t":" "},{"t":"높아서","l":"높다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"등산하기에","l":"등산하다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"딱","l":"딱"},{"t":" "},{"t":"좋은","l":"좋다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"계절이에요","l":"계절"},{"t":"."},{"t":"\n"},{"t":"겨울은","l":"겨울"},{"t":" "},{"t":"눈이","l":"눈"},{"t":" "},{"t":"많이","l":"많다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"오고","l":"오다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"매우","l":"매우"},{"t":" "},{"t":"추워서","l":"춥다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"두꺼운","l":"두껍다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"옷을","l":"옷"},{"t":" "},{"t":"입어야","l":"입다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"하지만","l":"하다"},{"t":","},{"t":" "},{"t":"따뜻한","l":"따뜻하다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"국물","l":"국물"},{"t":" "},{"t":"요리를","l":"요리"},{"t":" "},{"t":"먹으면","l":"먹다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"행복해져요","l":"행복해지다"},{"t":"."},{"t":"\n"},{"t":"한국","l":"한국"},{"t":" "},{"t":"사람들은","l":"사람"},{"t":" "},{"t":"계절마다","l":"계절"},{"t":" "},{"t":"다른","l":"다르다"},{"t":