    'K-Pop dan Hallyu',
    'K-Pop and the Korean Wave',
    'K-Pop은 전 세계적으로 인기가 많은 한국 음악이에요. BTS, 블랙핑크 같은 그룹들이 해외에서도 큰 사랑을 받고 있어요. K-Pop 아이돌들은 노래뿐만 아니라 춤도 아주 잘 추기 때문에 팬들이 열광해요. 한류는 음악 외에도 드라마와 영화를 통해 세계로 퍼지고 있어요. 많은 외국인들이 한국 드라마를 보면서 한국어를 배우기 시작했어요. 한류 덕분에 한국 음식과 패션에 대한 관심도 높아졌어요. 이처럼 K-Pop과 한류는 한국 문화를 세계에 알리는 중요한 역할을 하고 있어요.',
    'K-Pop adalah musik Korea yang populer di seluruh dunia. Grup seperti BTS dan BLACKPINK sangat dicintai juga di luar negeri. Idol K-Pop tidak hanya menyanyi tapi juga menari dengan sangat baik, sehingga penggemar sangat antusias. Hallyu menyebar ke dunia tidak hanya melalui musik tetapi juga melalui drama dan film. Banyak orang asing mulai belajar bahasa Korea sambil menonton drama Korea. Berkat Hallyu, minat terhadap makanan dan mode Korea juga meningkat. Dengan demikian, K-Pop dan Hallyu memainkan peran penting dalam memperkenalkan budaya Korea ke dunia.',
    'K-Pop is Korean music that is popular worldwide. Groups like BTS and BLACKPINK are greatly loved overseas. K-Pop idols not only sing but also dance very well, which makes fans go wild. The Korean Wave spreads to the world not only through music but also through dramas and movies. Many foreigners started learning Korean while watching Korean dramas. Thanks to Hallyu, interest in Korean food and fashion has also increased. In this way, K-Pop and Hallyu play an important role in promoting Korean culture to the world.',
    'intermediate',
    'k_culture',
    'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1493225457124-a3eb161ffa5f?q=80&w=400&auto=format&fit=crop',
    TRUE,
    '[{"t":"K-Pop은","l":"K-Pop"},{"t":" "},{"t":"전","l":"전"},{"t":" "},{"t":"세계적으로","l":"세계적"},{"t":" "},{"t":"인기가","l":"인기"},{"t":" "},{"t":"많은","l":"많다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"한국","l":"한국"},{"t":" "},{"t":"음악이에요","l":"음악"},{"t":"."},{"t":"\n"},{"t":"BTS","l":"BTS"},{"t":","},{"t":" "},{"t":"블랙핑크","l":"블랙핑크"},{"t":" "},{"t":"같은","l":"같다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"그룹들이","l":"그룹"},{"t":" "},{"t":"해외에서도","l":"해외"},{"t":" "},{"t":"큰","l":"크다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"사랑을","l":"사랑"},{"t":" "},{"t":"받고","l":"받다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"있어요","l":"있다"},{"t":"."},{"t":"\n"},{"t":"K-Pop","l":"K-Pop"},{"t":" "},{"t":"아이돌들은","l":"아이돌"},{"t":" "},{"t":"노래뿐만","l":"노래"},{"t":" "},{"t":"아니라","l":"아니다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"춤도","l":"춤"},{"t":" "},{"t":"아주","l":"아주"},{"t":" "},{"t":"잘","l":"잘"},{"t":" "},{"t":"추기","l":"추다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"때문에","l":"때문"},{"t":" "},{"t":"팬들이","l":"팬"},{"t":" "},{"t":"열광해요","l":"열광하다"},{"t":"."},{"t":"\n"},{"t":"한류는","l":"한류"},{"t":" "},{"t":"음악","l":"음악"},{"t":" "},{"t":"외에도","l":"외"},{"t":" "},{"t":"드라마와","l":"드라마"},{"t":" "},{"t":"영화를","l":"영화"},{"t":" "},{"t":"통해","l":"통하다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"세계로","l":"세계"},{"t":" "},{"t":"퍼지고","l":"퍼지다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"있어요","l":"있다"},{"t":"."},{"t":"\n"},{"t":"많은","l":"많다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"외국인들이","l":"외국인"},{"t":" "},{"t":"한국","l":"한국"},{"t":" "},{"t":"드라마를","l":"드라마"},{"t":" "},{"t":"보면서","l":"보다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"한국어를","l":"한국어"},{"t":" "},{"t":"배우기","l":"배우다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"시작했어요","l":"시작하다"},{"t":"."},{"t":"\n"},{"t":"한류","l":"한류"},{"t":" "},{"t":"덕분에","l":"덕분"},{"t":" "},{"t":"한국","l":"한국"},{"t":" "},{"t":"음식과","l":"음식"},{"t":" "},{"t":"패션에","l":"패션"},{"t":" "},{"t":"대한","l":"대하다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"관심도","l":"관심"},{"t":" "},{"t":"높아졌어요","l":"높아지다"},{"t":"."},{"t":"\n"},{"t":"이처럼","l":"이처럼"},{"t":" "},{"t":"K-Pop과","l":"K-Pop"},{"t":" "},{"t":"한류는","l":"한류"},{"t":" "},{"t":"한국","l":"한국"},{"t":" "},{"t":"문화를","l":"문화"},{"t":" "},{"t":"세계에","l":"세계"},{"t":" "},{"t":"알리는","l":"알리다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"중요한","l":"중요하다"},{"t":" "},{"t":"역할을","l":"역할"},{